Add_Dynamic_Module Mechanics Appeal_Default_2D_Side_Scrolling_Mechanics
Run Examples/Graphics/Setup_Character_Mechanics
Call Adam_Move_Right
Set_Var Adam_Axis Var Adam_Direction
Call Character_Mechanics_Update
Print_Global Mechanics.Adam.Position_X
Print_Global Mechanics.Eve.Position_X
Set_Var Adam_Running 1
Call Character_Mechanics_Update
Print_Global Mechanics.Adam.Position_X
Print_Global Mechanics.Adam.Action
Set_Var Adam_Ducking 1
Call Character_Mechanics_Update
Print_Global Mechanics.Adam.Position_X
Print_Global Mechanics.Adam.Action
Call Adam_Stop
Set_Var Adam_Axis 0
Call Character_Mechanics_Update
Print_Global Mechanics.Adam.Action
Call Adam_Jump
Call Character_Mechanics_Update
Print_Global Mechanics.Adam.Position_Y
Print_Global Mechanics.Adam.Action
Set_Var Eve_Axis -50
Call Character_Mechanics_Update
Print_Global Mechanics.Eve.Position_X
Print_Global Mechanics.Eve.Velocity_X
Print_Global Mechanics.Adam.Orientation
Done
